		<Meldungstext>\T\Y\F\J\NY\Y\S\J\NZ\L\S\G\A Indication:\Y\S\K\N

I\L\S\K\N Compressor disconnection codes.\L\B\K\I
00: not off
01: charge pressure (&gt;= 32 bar) 
02: fan faulty
03: pressure too low (&lt;= 2 bar) 
04: no indication
05: engine ignition recognised
06: ECON functioning (air conditioning not on)
07:functioning OFF (fan key in 0 position)
08: ambient temperature (&lt;= -3 ºC)
09: fan off
10: low voltage at Kl15 (&lt; 10.1 V)
11: temperature indication (engine temperature &gt; 118 ºC)
12: compressor power limit 
13: Kl15 charge pressure (&gt; 17 V)
14: evaporator temperature
15: no indication
16: off by compressor control unit (owing to control error)
17: pressure sensor failure
18: off by onboard voltage control unit\L\S\K\N
</Meldungstext>
